            <div xml:id="d787">

                <pb facs="0693" n="683" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg683"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.936/4–2349: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-04-23T17:00:00+08:00">April 23, 1949—5
                            p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received April 23—8:59 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>840. April 23 burned bulk of classified files. Small amount classified material,
                    currently needed codes and code machine not being destroyed for time being.</p>
                <p>Sent Department; repeated Shanghai 426, AmEmb Canton 288.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stuart</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
